Package: sensinghub-sensors-daemon
Architecture: arm64
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
# dlopen
 libfastrpc1
Breaks:
 qcom-sensors-registry (<<2.1.1-0qli1~bpo13+1),
 qcom-sensors-services (<<2.1.1-0qli1~bpo13+1),
Replaces:
 qcom-sensors-registry (<<2.1.1-0qli1~bpo13+1),
 qcom-sensors-services (<<2.1.1-0qli1~bpo13+1),
Description: Qualcomm Sensing Hub (sensors daemon)
 Qualcomm Sensing Hub (QSH) is an always-on, low-power interface designed to
 collect, process, and combine sensor and contextual data. It offers stable
 APIs that enable applications and services to interact with the hub
 efficiently, reducing the need for frequent application processor wakeups.
 .
 This package installs the sensors daemon.

